Bugfix: prune: document all size suffixes accepted by `--repack-smaller-than`

The help text for `--repack-smaller-than` only listed the `m/M` suffix, even
though the value is parsed like the other size options of `restic prune`.
Restic now lists `k/K, m/M, g/G, t/T` for the flag, so sizes such as `500k`
or `2g` are shown as valid input.

https://github.com/restic/restic/pull/22137
